            "line": 954,
            "text": "noncomputable def derivativeCoefficient (d : TailData) (eta : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  d.core.lam * ((1 / 2 - d.h) + geometricSource d eta) * (1 - d.core.lam) /\n    (decay d.core ^ 2 * equilibriumNumerator d eta)"
